# Release builds temporarily overwrite these tracked placeholder files with private key material.
# '-diff' makes git print "Binary files differ" instead of their contents, so a swapped key can never be
# echoed by git diff / show / log -p (in any clone, including AI tooling sessions). Merging is unaffected.
**/Common-Keys.h -diff
**/Common-Keys.cpp -diff
**/Encryptor.h -diff
**/Encryptor.cpp -diff
**/DBDLLCoreEncryptCall.cpp -diff
